# Store every file byte-for-byte as exported from the original STM32CubeIDE
# project. Most sources/configs use CRLF (Windows), a few use LF; disabling
# end-of-line conversion keeps clones identical to the original files
# regardless of each user's core.autocrlf setting.
* -text

# Binary files (no diff/merge)
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.elf    binary
*.bin    binary
*.hex    binary
